  "description": "Opens a lesson screen in the browser next to the terminal while a course tutor teaches. It shows the lesson's registered figures, code traces with real values, and clickable predictions. It also builds a figure for the lesson on the fly with the course figure skills and any figure skill the host has installed: a blueprint, a mechanism, an isometric machine, or a 3D model. Clicks return to the tutor as events. Trigger phrases: \"open the lesson screen\", \"show me this visually\", \"show this in 3D\", \"draw the architecture\", \"visualize this lesson\", \"build a figure for this lesson\", \"lesson screen\".",
